            {
              "id": "elem-t2",
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Key Intuition: Surface area of sphere = 4\\pi r^2 \\implies E(4\\pi r^2) = \\frac{q}{\\varepsilon_0} \\implies E = \\frac{q}{4\\pi\\varepsilon_0 r^2}",
